        <mxCell id="cell-110" value="Hold unsafe dependent work and return the owner and next action. Preserve independently valid functions.&#10;Observe the original operation using the same business, environment and correlation. Confirmed success resumes&#10;its exact parent gate; proven absence permits only qualified safe retry. Conflict or unresolved state remains&#10;on hold with evidence and an escalation owner. An empty or failed query is not proof of absence; recovered&#10;success cannot commit a route." parent="1" vertex="1" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=17;fontColor=#222222;spacing=0;">
